ব্যাংক নিয়োগ প্রস্তুতি.exp:
A <strong>blue-violet laser</strong> is used to read data from a Blu-Ray disk because it has a shorter wavelength and can focus more tightly, allowing for greater data storage capacity on the disk.&nbsp;
<div>This is the primary reason for the increased storage capacity of a Blu-Ray disk compared to a DVD.</div>
<div><br />Reference: "Blu-ray Disc Demystified" by Scott W. Cunningham, McGraw-Hill Professional; 2 edition (January 15, 2009)</div>
